          "attrs": {
            "kind": "interview",
            "manager_type": -1,
            "stage": 0,
            "weight": 1
          },
          "type": "Comment",
          "text": "면담 이벤트 설정",
          "attachedTo": "2196d9ad-3f78-5f2b-9b06-74381b452b0d"
        },
        "477e32f2-d0b6-5af1-8c19-90491d066437": {
          "localId": 6,
          "type": "Select",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "d1087154-782b-529f-9333-199d66800c93",
              "text": "무슨 일 있어? 천천히 말해 봐.",
              "next": "83ae2a06-4f76-5722-96ec-c7c88c75898f",
              "attrs": {
                "effects": "ok>trust:+6;ng>trust:+2"
              },
              "i18n": {
                "En": {
                  "text": "Something wrong? Take your time."
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "9ee8f7c6-3867-521e-a235-7918332b9e75",
              "text": "컨디션 관리도 실력이야.",
              "next": "36da7a55-9a7e-57f1-9ef6-0ea073d23071",
              "attrs": {
                "effects": "trust:-1"
              },
              "i18n": {
                "En": {
                  "text": "Managing your condition is part of the job."
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "729109ed-2cd1-57d4-9e6e-92d578797b13",
              "text": "내일 얘기하자. 오늘은 쉬어.",
              "next": "8ef0d8c5-9481-5b1c-b03d-603536c38cbb",
              "attrs": {
                "effects": "trust:+2"
              },
              "i18n": {
                "En": {
                  "text": "Let's talk tomorrow. Get some rest tonight."
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "83ae2a06-4f76-5722-96ec-c7c88c75898f": {
          "localId": 7,
          "attrs": {
            "branch": "ok"
          },
          "type": "Dialog",
          "speaker": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
          "lines": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "들어 주셔서 감사해요. 한결 낫네요."
            }
          ],
          "i18n": {
            "En": {
              "lines": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "Thanks for listening. I feel a lot better."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "next": "8fa1d384-aa59-5074-8069-899ce3b94f7c"
        },
        "8fa1d384-aa59-5074-8069-899ce3b94f7c": {
          "localId": 8,
          "attrs": {
            "branch": "ng"
          },
          "type": "Dialog",
          "speaker": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
          "lines": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "아니에요. 그냥 피곤한가 봐요."
            }
          ],
          "i18n": {
            "En": {
              "lines": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "It's nothing. I guess I'm just tired."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "next": "958fc40f-b338-5819-bf9c-12fad66c61be"
        },
        "36da7a55-9a7e-57f1-9ef6-0ea073d23071": {
          "localId": 9,
          "type": "Dialog",
          "speaker": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
          "lines": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "네. 알고 있어요."
            }
          ],
          "i18n": {
            "En": {
              "lines": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "Yeah. I know."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "next": "958fc40f-b338-5819-bf9c-12fad66c61be"
        },
        "8ef0d8c5-9481-5b1c-b03d-603536c38cbb": {
          "localId": 10,
          "type": "Dialog",
          "speaker": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
          "lines": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "네 감독님. 푹 잘게요."
